Re-linking note (LGPL-3.0 section 4d0): to substitute a modified psycopg, build
the backend image with a replacement psycopg wheel installed in place of the
pinned version (the C extension `psycopg_binary` is an optional acceleration of
the pure-Python `psycopg`; the pure-Python package can be used standalone).

================================================================================
Deliberately excluded components
================================================================================

The following strong-copyleft components are intentionally NOT shipped, and a
gate (scripts/check_license_compat.py) keeps them out:

  - pymupdf / fitz / pymupdf4llm (AGPL-3.0): excluded from all dependency tables.
  - golangci-lint (GPL-3.0):   used only as an external developer/CI binary,
                               never a Go module dependency of the CLI.
